- Superseded harness captures: `protocol-acceptance-run1.json` 20/31,
  `protocol-acceptance-run2.json` 29/31; final and integrated runs are 31/31.
- Router dispatch is not inside this harness. Exact-file
  [../../releases/cielairouter-transient-retry/evidence/scopes-gateways.txt](../../releases/cielairouter-transient-retry/evidence/scopes-gateways.txt)
  ran 108 tests `OK` in 11.411 s, including
  `RouterHttpHandler._dispatch_with_failover` (selected gateway, inactive
  failover, non-LLM/other-provider paths), provider/gateway transport, overlay
  session stickiness and handled-error guards. Stalled loopback:
  `elapsed=0.172s socket_timeout=0.150s opens=1 retries=0 handled=True`.
- Still not covered by any recorded capture: a live runtime with a real
